{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a031533bfa705fc5c53fcaf24e6901f5.poster.avif?t=1747692419\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a031533bfa705fc5c53fcaf24e6901f5.webm?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a031533bfa705fc5c53fcaf24e6901f5.mp4?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Put your feet up &amp; let your hair down, and spend some time filling an empty void with a vibrant little landscape. Biotopia aims to be a perfect companion while listening to a podcast or an audio book, with its addictive yet unobtrusive gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/80b2e8057d8930946fa06cae9da17a88.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/0cca6f5b530434422fe848e53f56dbc3.poster.avif?t=1747692419\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/0cca6f5b530434422fe848e53f56dbc3.webm?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/0cca6f5b530434422fe848e53f56dbc3.mp4?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Earn points by connecting tiles with similar biomes, and earn coveted <i>bonus tiles</i> by planning your placements carefully. Enjoy getting into the zone and staying there, plopping down pieces one by one and making the world grow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/1cd39d5ea13cb3b149b2eeb6ec33ca92.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a796fe0244f5beb44af98f3c4599e02f.avif?t=1747692419\" width=616 height=169 /></span><br>Diversity increases as your landscape expands, and new biomes will unlock when you reach certain milestones. All these can attract different kinds of wildlife; each with their own requirements and desires. Try finding them all, and complete the expansive ingame <i>biotopedia</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/68a9ec7762e1a97ee77860ab990ecee2.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Highscore mode</strong> if you want to challenge yourself and unlock a bunch of achievements.<br></li><li><strong>Endless mode</strong> if you prefer to relax and play in your own way without any failure states.<br></li><li><strong>Creative mode</strong> if you'd rather be a worldscaper and paint the world as you see fit.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/639a6d1c2a1e68a5db5346618188808f.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br>Biotopia is under active development by a single person. If you have any questions, suggestions or feedback I would love to hear from you!<br><br>I'm putting together a demo ASAP, so <strong>wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow</strong> to get it as soon as it\u2019s available! &lt;3","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2363600?t=1747692419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747692419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747692419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747692419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3643100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a031533bfa705fc5c53fcaf24e6901f5.poster.avif?t=1747692419\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a031533bfa705fc5c53fcaf24e6901f5.webm?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a031533bfa705fc5c53fcaf24e6901f5.mp4?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Put your feet up &amp; let your hair down, and spend some time filling an empty void with a vibrant little landscape. Biotopia aims to be a perfect companion while listening to a podcast or an audio book, with its addictive yet unobtrusive gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/80b2e8057d8930946fa06cae9da17a88.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/0cca6f5b530434422fe848e53f56dbc3.poster.avif?t=1747692419\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/0cca6f5b530434422fe848e53f56dbc3.webm?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/0cca6f5b530434422fe848e53f56dbc3.mp4?t=1747692419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Earn points by connecting tiles with similar biomes, and earn coveted <i>bonus tiles</i> by planning your placements carefully. Enjoy getting into the zone and staying there, plopping down pieces one by one and making the world grow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/1cd39d5ea13cb3b149b2eeb6ec33ca92.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/a796fe0244f5beb44af98f3c4599e02f.avif?t=1747692419\" width=616 height=169 /></span><br>Diversity increases as your landscape expands, and new biomes will unlock when you reach certain milestones. All these can attract different kinds of wildlife; each with their own requirements and desires. Try finding them all, and complete the expansive ingame <i>biotopedia</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/68a9ec7762e1a97ee77860ab990ecee2.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Highscore mode</strong> if you want to challenge yourself and unlock a bunch of achievements.<br></li><li><strong>Endless mode</strong> if you prefer to relax and play in your own way without any failure states.<br></li><li><strong>Creative mode</strong> if you'd rather be a worldscaper and paint the world as you see fit.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/extras/639a6d1c2a1e68a5db5346618188808f.webp?t=1747692419\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br>Biotopia is under active development by a single person. If you have any questions, suggestions or feedback I would love to hear from you!<br><br>I'm putting together a demo ASAP, so <strong>wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow</strong> to get it as soon as it\u2019s available! &lt;3","developers":["loboflex"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363600/header.jpg?t=1747692419","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2363600/583414/e8797971bd66c61d7faa1a339e2f2ce3fda5a2f3/1750911376/dash_av1.mpd?t=1688628322","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2363600/583414/e8797971bd66c61d7faa1a339e2f2ce3fda5a2f3/1750911376/dash_h264.mpd?t=1688628322","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2363600/583414/e8797971bd66c61d7faa1a339e2f2ce3fda5a2f3/1750911376/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1688628322","id":256955985,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256955985/movie480.mp4?t=1688628322","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256955985/movie_max.mp4?t=1688628322"},"name":"Biotopia Pre-alpha gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256955985/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1688628322","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256955985/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1688628322","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256955985/movie_max_vp9